@page
@model BolaoCopa2026.Pages.Conta.PerfilModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Perfil";
}

<section class="page-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Conta</p>
    <h1>Perfil do Participante</h1>
</section>

<section class="profile-layout">
    <article class="panel">
        <h2>Acesso</h2>
        <form class="stacked-form">
            <label>
                Login
                <input type="text" value="participante.demo" />
            </label>
            <label>
                Email
                <input type="email" value="participante@example.com" />
            </label>
            <label>
                Senha
                <input type="password" value="password" />
            </label>
            <button class="btn-app" type="button">Atualizar perfil</button>
        </form>
    </article>

    <article class="panel muted-panel">
        <h2>Proxima etapa tecnica</h2>
        <p>Esta tela reserva o fluxo de login e senha. A implementacao definitiva deve usar ASP.NET Core Identity com banco de dados para autenticar participantes e administradores.</p>
    </article>
</section>
